  "text": "Fixed video caching bottleneck by enabling range request caching. The code was explicitly excluding 206 responses from cache, which meant every video seek hit the worker + R2. Now range requests are cached with 1-year TTL.\n\nCombined with Cache Reserve (needs dashboard config), this should dramatically reduce:\n- Worker invocations (cache hits bypass worker entirely)\n- R2 egress bandwidth (cache serves from edge)\n- Latency (edge cache vs worker + R2 round trip)\n\nCache headers were already optimal (public, max-age=31536000, immutable). Just needed to stop blocking the caching.",
  "sections": [
    "Project Notes"
  ],
